{
  "revision": "supervisor-v1:71a1bff89ffcfee40d96a3543611e87d8eb361c3fa550ab4854fb63d0f44119e:text-edits:93e9f133d9c128cf07becbf5aec949bdde91ec293db9eb418e7903f9db190b90",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "morningCount": 16,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_001",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "你就是新来的审查员？",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_002",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_002",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "现在他们招人的标准都这么低了吗？",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_003",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_003",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，你这是什么表情？",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_004",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_004",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "别介意嘛，开个小玩笑。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_005",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_005",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "你应该很清楚每天的工作流程吧？",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_006",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_006",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "总之，就是好好教育一下那些社会的蛀虫们。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_007",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_007",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "你可以继续治疗，把他们留到第二天继续教育，这样我们兄弟几个在“治疗”的时候也能找点乐子。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_008",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_008",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "实在没法教育的，就直接选择“净化”吧，让他们去建设我们的伟大祖国。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_009",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 9
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_009",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "待会记得留意屏幕下面的“社会适应度”指示器，他们越不听话，指示器的表现就越狂躁。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_010",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_010",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "如果你足够擅长和人打交道的话，也许能让他们的社会适应度变得符合规范，那你就能“释放”他们了。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_011",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 11
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_011",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "但是释放可不是什么好事呀。每天至少净化一个人，才算完成指标。释放可不算，记住了。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_012",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_012",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "要我说还是别释放他们吧，好不容易抓进来你又给放了，这不是打上头的脸吗？",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_013",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 13
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_013",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "我每天都会来看望你的，这样你就不会太孤单了嘛。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_014",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 14
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_014",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "好了，检测时间到。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_015",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 15
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_015",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "我们可是很关注公务员的心理健康的。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_016",
          "portraitId": "JD_04",
          "sourceRow": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_016",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "这玩意真方便，以前抓人还需要证据，现在让他扫一下就行了。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_017",
          "portraitId": "JD_04",
          "sourceRow": 17
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_017",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "不错嘛，你通过了检测。",
          "next": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_018",
          "portraitId": "JD_05",
          "sourceRow": 18
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D1_R1_COMMON_018",
          "day": 1,
          "text": "好好干，我还会再来的。",
          "next": "",
          "portraitId": "JD_05",
          "sourceRow": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "morningCount": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_001",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "又见面了。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_002",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_002",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "据我所知，你的活干得还不错嘛。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_003",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 21
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_003",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "让我听那些蛀虫说话，我可没那么多耐心。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_004",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 22
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_004",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "喂，我说。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_005",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 23
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_005",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "他们说的话，你不会真听了吧？",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_006",
          "portraitId": "JD_02",
          "sourceRow": 24
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_006",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "之前有个审查员听信了里面那些人的话，最后没能通过仪器检测。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_007",
          "portraitId": "JD_02",
          "sourceRow": 25
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_007",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "他自然也成为了里面的一员。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_008",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 26
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_008",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "如果你不想重蹈覆辙，那我劝你少搭理他们。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_009",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 27
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_009",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "闲聊就到这吧。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_010",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 28
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_010",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "让我看看你是不是真的过关。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_011",
          "portraitId": "JD_05",
          "sourceRow": 29
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_011",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "不错嘛。",
          "next": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_012",
          "portraitId": "JD_04",
          "sourceRow": 30
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D2_R1_COMMON_012",
          "day": 2,
          "text": "你最好继续保持。",
          "next": "",
          "portraitId": "JD_04",
          "sourceRow": 31
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "day": 3,
      "morningCount": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_001",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "我又来了。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_002",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 32
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_002",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "你还真是厉害啊。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_003",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 33
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_003",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "我们都在关注你，搞不好你很快就能升职了。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_004",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 34
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_004",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "开玩笑的。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_005",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 35
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_005",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "你还真信了？",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_006",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 36
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_006",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "路要一步一步走，孩子。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_007",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 37
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_007",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "升职可没那么容易，更没那么快。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_008",
          "portraitId": "JD_03",
          "sourceRow": 38
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_008",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "顺带一提，你刚才的表情也被我记录下来了。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_009",
          "portraitId": "JD_01",
          "sourceRow": 39
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_009",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "好了，笑一个。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_010",
          "portraitId": "JD_04",
          "sourceRow": 40
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_010",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "哦哦，你又一次通过了啊。",
          "next": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_011",
          "portraitId": "JD_05",
          "sourceRow": 41
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D3_R1_COMMON_011",
          "day": 3,
          "text": "明天也许就没那么好运了。",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002",
          "portraitId": "JD_05",
          "sourceRow": 42
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "day": 4,
      "morningCount": 0,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "惊——喜。",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 43
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "做过什么你自己清楚。",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 44
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "看来你要跟我走一趟了。",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 45
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "进去之后，记得好好表现。",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 46
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "也许就不会那么早迎来净化。",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 47
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "我们之间也能多玩一会，不是吗？",
          "next": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 48
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007",
          "day": 4,
          "text": "走吧。",
          "next": "",
          "portraitId": "JD_06",
          "sourceRow": 49
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
